  "kind": "quirk",
  "title": "HYPERLINK coerces link_location to text and returns friendly_name verbatim (or 0 for a blank cell) when supplied",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20527, HYPERLINK(link_location, [friendly_name]) coerces link_location to text and returns that text when friendly_name is omitted; when friendly_name is supplied, it returns friendly_name unchanged (preserving numbers, text, logicals, and errors, or 0 for an empty cell reference). Matches 3,612/3,612 full-bank HYPERLINK rows.",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured across all 3,612 full-bank HYPERLINK rows in Excel 16.0.20527 (CalcFunc-Evidence admit2-answers-hyperlink-*.json), prefix_metadata (row 288), and f2_rows (row 179).",
